# MacroZone

A nutrition tracking app built with Expo and React Native.

## Features
- Log meals with calorie and macronutrient breakdown
- Daily macro progress against targets
- Local persistence, works fully offline
- Local reminder notifications
- Haptic feedback, native share and clipboard

## Tech
Expo SDK 5x · Expo Router (file-based routing) · TypeScript (strict)
· AsyncStorage · expo-notifications · EAS Build

## Architecture notes
Storage is isolated behind `lib/storage.ts` so the persistence layer
can be swapped without touching any component.

